//! [`crate::route::Route`] via the first-party [`crate::providers`] facades
//! (`OpenAi`, `Anthropic`, `OpenAiCompatible`). See
//! `browser-use-agent::turn::model_path`.

/// Codex `auth.json` reader + route builder (chatgpt.com login support).
pub mod codex;

